2. Definitions.
- In these rules, unless the context otherwise requires, -
(a)
"Act" means the Goa Panchayat Raj Act, 1994 (Act 14 of 1994);
(b)
"clear days" means days exclusive of the day of issue of a notice or intimation, and of the day of meeting;
(c)
"motion" means a proposal to evoke action on the part of the Panchayat and includes an amendment of a motion;
(d)
"member" means a member of Panchayat;
(e)
words used but not defined shall have same meanings as assigned to them in the Act.
